From cbf90aeda1c9d1f3b00fb7a28d1c4ecd06a26666 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rmuxnet <116457149+rmuxnet@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Jan 2026 15:55:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(UI & Backend): Implement Payload Delay System & Visual
 Toggles

- Backend: Add `payload_delay_flags.json` storage and API endpoints for delay toggles.
- Backend: Update auto-jailbreak sequence to respect global delay time and per-payload flags.
- UI (Settings): Add Global Delay configuration input (default 5s).
- UI (Index/Settings): Add visual "Delay" toggle button to payload cards with immediate Toast feedback.
- UI: Sync delay state (blue active/gray inactive) across all payload lists.
